  "next_gate_zh": "关闭按同一归一化像素坐标平均 peer residual 的 v137 表示。下一门改为几何上更真实的射线重叠/极线输运：利用已知相机内外参沿目标射线设置冻结深度锚点，把其他相机的有符号 residual 重采样到对应极线位置，形成相机换序等变、可变数量的便宜跨视角消息。仍先跑确定性 control 和 truth-aware capacity；只有 3700/3700 与 5/5 完整轨迹同时过门，才允许最小预测器。",
  "next_gate_en": "Close the v137 representation that averages peer residuals at the same normalized detector coordinate. The next gate uses physically meaningful ray-overlap or epipolar transport: frozen depth anchors along each target ray reproject signed peer residuals through known intrinsics and extrinsics into corresponding epipolar locations, yielding a variable-cardinality, camera-permutation-equivariant cheap message. Deterministic controls and truth-aware capacity come first; a minimal predictor is authorized only after 3,700/3,700 cells and 5/5 complete trajectories pass.",
